Third-party components and references

This repository documents a lab that uses the following projects and frameworks.
They are not redistributed here; they remain under their own licences and are
credited to their authors:

- Terraform and the AWS provider by HashiCorp, Mozilla Public License 2.0.
  https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws
- Sigma (generic detection rule format) by the SigmaHQ project,
  Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 for rule content.
  https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma
- MITRE ATT&CK, used for technique mapping, (c) The MITRE Corporation.
  https://attack.mitre.org

The custom Athena detections, Sigma rules, Terraform, documentation, and reports
authored for this project are released under the MIT License above.
